{QP, Chigorin Defence:} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 Nc6 {Not available. Tregaskis ventured
into his opponent's camp with his Q and gave her up, remaining with two Rs and
a P plus against Q and B. Tregaskis put up a great fight and at the
adjournment was still keeping it going. Finally, though giving up a P and the
Exchange, he got a P down to the 7th and a draw by perpetual check was the
best Spencer could do.} 1/2-1/2

